d_at":"2026-10-23T11:52:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113599432667304174"],"id":"2113599432667304174","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":15778,"like_count":21,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":24,"retweet_count":0},"text":"主人这次有点事走不开，zw完睡了会下午觉，睡醒之后就晚上了，收拾了零食和打扫了卫生，舍友现在也都不在，我一个人吹着空调看着电视，好舒适呀","url":"https://x.com/MomoYiyi2225/status/2113599432667304174"},{"author_id":"1989528016364736513","created_at":"2026-10-22T17:30:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113322004841636344"],"id":"2113322004841636344","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":17024,"like_count":21,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":31,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我感觉我特别适合和内向的人玩，而且我特别恶趣味啊，说话特别小声我就假装听不到让他再说一遍，因为我话特别多，上学的时候我很吵老师就会安排安静的同学做我旁边，然后有次同学过生日，他妈妈跟我说，跟我说跟我做同桌之后，感觉人都变开朗了…但是把我换到哪里我都能聊起来，后面老师也是随便我了","url":"https://x.com/MomoYiyi2225/status/2113322004841636344"},{"author_id":"1989528016364736513","created_at":"2026-10-21T16:01:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112937313496084656"],"id":"2112937313496084656","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":22984,"like_count":71,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":54,"retweet_count":0},"text":"其实五天没zw了…今天猛猛插一下，等周末要好好被玩，我主人说我很嚣张…","url":"https://x.com/MomoYiyi2225/status/2112937313496084656"},{"author_id":"1989528016364736513","created_at":"2026-10-21T03:53:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112754230243274771"],"id":"2112754230243274771","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":28098,"like_count":21,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":22,"retweet_count":0},"text":"好想玩软开…能不能给我推荐几个博主啊，好喜欢听惨叫…  #软开","url":"https://x.com/MomoYiyi2225/status/2112754230243274771"},{"author_id":"1989528016364736513","created_at":"2026-10-20T15:25:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112565874418991560"],"id":"2112565874418991560","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":21720,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":22,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我早上睡觉要是被吵醒我会特别生气，在家里都没有人会吵我睡觉，都会很安静的做事情，舍友也是，只要有一个人没醒大家都会保持安静，和主人见面的时候，主人前一天晚上说早上会过来，但是我怕我会撒起床气，我就会定闹钟提前起床，结果我主人睡过去没醒。只有主人我才会这样做。。","url":"https://x.com/MomoYiyi2225/status/2112565874418991560"},{"author_id":"1989528016364736513","created_at":"2026-10-20T15:18:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112564116686877010"],"id":"2112564116686877010","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":136045,"like_count":356,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":98,"retweet_count":1},"text":"上瑜伽课学了一个能看到b的姿势…","url":"https://x.com/MomoYiyi2225/status/2112564116686877010"},{"author_id":"1989528016364736513","created_at":"2026-10-17T17:14:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111506046749745292"],"id":"2111506046749745292","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":22059,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":27,"retweet_count":0},"text":"这种小心思只给你做 https://t.co/yNuu4ItT2v","url":"https://x.com/MomoYiyi2225/status/2111506046749745292"},{"author_id":"1989528016364736513","created_at":"2026-10-17T11:39:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111421785124348013"],"id":"2111421785124348013","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":76,"impression_count":25539,"like_count":386,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":5},"text":"主人射的好多… https://t.co/Pj497uLYsM","url":"https://x.com/MomoYiyi2225/status/2111421785124348013"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"1989528016364736513","name":"光滑的水煮蛋","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2084917187740151808/_pQusCuv_normal.jpg","username":"MomoYiyi2225","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2117502390094213353","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlvzfxm83tvd97dornpsndiicc59","oldest_id":"2111421785124348013","result_count":18}}